  "description": "Returns the total number of a customer's orders matching a date range and optional order-type filter — the unpaginated companion to `getCustomerOrders`, used to drive its pagination controls.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `customerId` — the customer whose orders to count.\n- `dateRange` — a local date range (inclusive); filtered in the car-wash timezone.\n- `orderTypes` — optional list restricting the count to `singleWash`, `memberWash`, `membershipBilling`, `washBook`, `fleet`, `other`, or `unknown`. `null` counts all types.\n\n## Output\n\nReturns `{ orderCount }` — the count of matching orders, or `0` when none match.",
