  "scope": "open",
  "noBody": true,
  "description": "Returns every active (non-deleted) promotion for the caller's organization, newest first, as full promotion records — each including its nested `offer` (with markdowns) and `autoTag`. This is the management/list view, not a stats report.\n\nTakes no input: the organization is resolved from the caller's auth context, so results are always scoped to that one organization.\n\n**Note:** This returns the promotion configuration (name, type, application type, validity window, offer, etc.), not redemption metrics — use `getStats` or `getStatsForPromotion` for funnel counts and revenue. Useful for listing or browsing all promotions an organization has configured.",
