 "revenueAnalytics_getLineItemsGroupedByClassification": {
  "path": "/external/revenue-analytics/get-line-items-grouped-by-classification",
  "summary": "Get Line Items Grouped by Classification",
  "signature": "{carWashIds: string[], dateRange: {start,end}, employeeIds?: string[]|null}",
  "scope": "carWashIds",
  "noBody": false,
  "description": "Returns the revenue breakdown that powers the Revenue Analytics dashboard: every paid order line item at the specified car washes during the date range, bucketed into one of 14 high-level classifications.\n\n## Classifications\n\n- `memberWashes`\n- `fleetWashes`\n- `promotionalWashes`\n- `singleWashes`\n- `miscellaneous`\n- `storeSales`\n- `otherWashes`\n- `membershipsSoldNew`\n- `membershipsSoldOnline`\n- `membershipsSoldManual`\n- `membershipsSoldReupVolChurn`\n- `membershipsSoldReupInvolChurn`\n- `membershipsRebilled`\n- `nonRevenue`\n\nEach classification contains categories (typically per package template / SKU) with line item count, service count, wash count, revenue in cents, and ticket average, plus a per-package-type breakdown inside each category.\n\nThe response includes both an aggregate roll-up across all selected car washes and a per-car-wash breakdown, along with the list of car washes and (when filtered) employees included in the result. Pass `employeeIds` to restrict to orders rung up by specific employees; omit it to include all employees.\n\nOrders flagged as fleet washes are bucketed under `fleetWashes` in preference to `promotionalWashes`, `memberWashes`, `singleWashes` and `otherWashes`. Line items that would otherwise be classified as tips/cash back (`nonRevenue`), taxes/refunds/voids (`miscellaneous`), a membership sale or rebill, or a store sale keep that classification even on a fleet order.\n\nUseful for answering questions about how revenue splits between member washes, fleet washes, retail single washes, new vs. rebilled memberships, store sales, and non-revenue line items at one or more locations.",
  "schema": {
   "type": "object",
   "properties": {
    "carWashIds": {
     "type": "array",
     "items": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "a valid car wash ID",
      "pattern": "^(?:(?!^-0$)-?(?:(?:0|[1-9]\\d*)))$",
      "minLength": 1
     }
    },
    "dateRange": {
     "type": "object",
     "properties": {
      "end": {
       "type": "string",
       "description": "date, YYYY-MM-DD"
      },
      "start": {
       "type": "string",
       "description": "date, YYYY-MM-DD"
      }
     },
     "required": [
      "end",
      "start"
     ],
     "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "employeeIds": {
     "anyOf": [
      {
       "type": "array",
       "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "a valid customer ID",
        "pattern": "^(?:(?!^-0$)-?(?:(?:0|[1-9]\\d*)))$"
       }
      },
      {
       "type": "null"
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "required": [
    "carWashIds",
    "dateRange"
   ],
   "additionalProperties": false
  }
 },
