  "description": "Returns a time series of wash counts for the specified car washes over the date range, bucketed by the caller-supplied `interval` (`hour` or `day`).\n\n## Per-bucket fields\n\nEach bucket includes:\n\n- `singleWashCount`\n- `memberWashCount`\n- the per-package-type breakdown (express, full-service, detail, fleet)\n- average checkout / gate-open / wash-send durations in seconds, split by single vs member washes\n\n## Bucketing\n\nBuckets are anchored to each car wash's local timezone; with `interval: 'hour'`, hours outside the configured operating window are folded into the opening or closing hour. Date range is capped at 60 days.\n\nPrefer `getWashStatsSummary` for a single aggregated total instead of a series, or `getWashAndRevenueStats` when you also need revenue at the same granularity.",
