  "description": "Returns wash counts grouped by package type (`membership`, `express`, `fullService`, `detail`, `fleet`, etc.) and then by package template within each type, summed over the entire date range with no time bucketing.\n\n## Per-template breakdown\n\nEach `byPackageTemplate` row splits its volume into `singleWashCount` and `memberWashCount` so callers can see how a given template is being consumed.\n\n## Inclusion rules\n\nIncludes `paid` and `refunded` orders, and only counts non-prepaid line items whose package template is flagged `countAsWash`; package templates with zero qualifying washes are filtered out. Date range is capped at 60 days.\n\nUseful as a drill-down companion to the summary counts in `getWashStatsSummary` when you need per-template detail.",
